#: build-src/install/index.md:37
msgid "Then you can run the compilation command for numahop:"
msgstr "Ensuite vous pouvez compiler NumaHOP a l'aide de cette commande:"

#: build-src/install/index.md:39
msgid "# Optionaly add: -Dfast=true\n"
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/index.md:41
msgid ""
"If you have errors during compilation run `mvn -Dfast=true package`. It "
"disables all exections non needed to build numahop such as tests, code "
"analysis and formating. Once the compilation succeds a file `./target/"
"numahop-<semver>.jar` should be present in the directory. Move this file at "
"this path: `/opt/pgcn/numahop.jar`. The name of the war is not important but "
"its location is. Once that is done we can run NumaHOP. It should launch and "
"crash rather quickly."
msgstr ""
"Si vous rencontrez des erreurs pendant la compilation de NumaHOP vous pouvez "
"essayer la commande `mvn -Dfast=true package`. Celle-ci désactive toute les "
"vérification et tous les test du code. Une fois la compilation terminée vous "
"trouverez le fichier `numahop-<calver>.jar` dans le dossier `target`. Vous "
"pouvez maintenant passer a l’étape de post installation."

